# Arrows Play release record: versionCode 21 (versionName 1.0.0), local bundleRelease from tag release/vc21 (no EAS).
# status: candidate
# The vc20 set unchanged plus WINTER-01 / CHRISTMAS-01 (owner yes 2026-11-18): EXPO_PUBLIC_META_WINTER_DECOR=1 (winter
# menu, in-game frost/drift/snowfall, native exit snow, only 1 Dec - end Feb by the phone clock) and EXPO_PUBLIC_META_AMBIENCE=1
# (winter ambience under the existing sound toggle), plus MOTION-AUDIT EXPO_PUBLIC_META_MOTION_POLISH=1 (owner yes 2026-11-18).
# New seasonal skins 24-31 ship through the existing META_SEASONS/REWARD_BOOK flags. QA flags (QA_DATE, QA_WINTER_SWITCH)
# and CAPTURE_DIAG are unset: no QA chips, real clock. vc21 supersedes the vc20 candidate.
# Shell use: set -a; . release/vc21.env; set +a
# Checked by src/__tests__/releaseRecord.test.ts. History: never edit a shipped record; add vc<N>.env.
# consent: EXPO_PUBLIC_CONSENT_GATE=1. Google UMP runs before AdMob starts and fails closed: no ad until UMP resolves, none after a refusal. Needs the AdMob GDPR message published first, or EEA players get no ads.
